    "about": {
        "title": "About",
        "intro1": "I'm a 3D generalist based in Germany, currently on the Master's course in <0>Virtual Design</0> at Hochschule Kaiserslautern, where I did my Bachelor's too.",
        "intro2": "Most of the work below comes from <0>relticc GmbH</0>, where I spent a bit under two years as a 3D generalist alongside the degree. Before that I was a research assistant at the university, working on VR, motion capture, and photogrammetry. Since October 2026 I'm back there, helping with 3D scanning and turning what we capture into VR applications.",
        "intro3": "Most of what I do sits between departments: scanning, processing footage, cleaning, rendering and compositing. I love understanding the tools and combining them to get the best result. I also shoot a lot, analog and digital.",
        "quotes": [
            {
                "text": "“He made full use of the freedom he was given, developing and carrying out his own technical solutions independently.”",
                "by": "Leon de Fries, Managing Director, relticc GmbH"
            },
            {
                "text": "“His work was marked by reliability, care and a high degree of technical expertise.”",
                "by": "Prof. Matthias Pfaff, Virtual Design, Hochschule Kaiserslautern"
            }
        ],
        "quotesNote": "From my references, translated from German."
    },
